&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a curriculum of speakers, trading games, mentorships, and social events throughout the summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a full-time PhD student in a quantitative discipline (math, physics, computer science, statistics, operations research, machine learning etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Python is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with statistical analysis, numerical programming, or machine learning in Python, Pandas/Numpy, R, and/or MATLAB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excited to apply your research expertise to identify new opportunities in worldwide markets &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
